  "description": "Stop using the ugly 3D gray WinForms TabControl. ModernTabControl.WinForms is a hardware-accelerated, fully customizable routing and navigation control. Features 3 Layout Modes (Top Underline, Top Pill, and Sidebar Navigation), 60 FPS smooth sliding tab indicators, native Dark/Light mode integration, and 5 premium design styles. Instantly modernize your application routing with zero dependencies.",
